			<div class="content" id="post-content-2799601">
									

<p>Oh hey, it's good old 562, now with less overt fetish fuel!</p>
<p>Honestly, I kinda miss the gonzo days of SCP. It was fun reading the site back then. I understood the purge of edgelord anime SCPs, but then every other entry that didn't fit a fairly narrow definition of horror got purged too, and for a few years it was really boring here. And even when you started to get some variety it quickly became basically &quot;Stargate meets Lovecraft&quot;, with all the interconnected alternate realities, eldritch societies and the like. Pitch Haven, Daevites, Sarkic stuff&#8230; it was just such a huge shift in tone. So I'm glad the gonzo stuff seems to be making a reappearance.</p>

